    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576390/extras/cd660ec4ef2901cd1bfd83884f177717.avif?t=1752164184\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576390/extras/86147705e37ce718597403e24913d5d7.avif?t=1752164184\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Roulette</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of the casino from the comfort of your home with <strong>Real Roulette</strong>. Our game offers the most authentic roulette experience, featuring both American and European rulesets with all the classic betting options you know and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics Simulation</strong>: Dive into a truly immersive experience with our advanced physics engine that accurately simulates the interactions between the ball and the wheel, ensuring every spin is as unpredictable and exciting as it is in a real casino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Data Analysis</strong>: Take your strategies to the next level with our extensive data analytics tools. Track your bets, analyze your performance, and develop optimal betting strategies to enhance your gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and Leaderboards</strong>: Challenge yourself with a variety of achievements and climb the leaderboards. Compete with players worldwide and prove your skills in the ultimate test of luck and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned pro or a newcomer to the world of roulette, <strong>Real Roulette</strong> offers an unparalleled gaming experience that caters to all. Spin the wheel, place your bets, and see if luck is on your side!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576390/extras/cd660ec4ef2901cd1bfd83884f177717.avif?t=1752164184\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576390/extras/86147705e37ce718597403e24913d5d7.avif?t=1752164184\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Roulette</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of the casino from the comfort of your home with <strong>Real Roulette</strong>. Our game offers the most authentic roulette experience, featuring both American and European rulesets with all the classic betting options you know and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics Simulation</strong>: Dive into a truly immersive experience with our advanced physics engine that accurately simulates the interactions between the ball and the wheel, ensuring every spin is as unpredictable and exciting as it is in a real casino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Data Analysis</strong>: Take your strategies to the next level with our extensive data analytics tools. Track your bets, analyze your performance, and develop optimal betting strategies to enhance your gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and Leaderboards</strong>: Challenge yourself with a variety of achievements and climb the leaderboards. Compete with players worldwide and prove your skills in the ultimate test of luck and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned pro or a newcomer to the world of roulette, <strong>Real Roulette</strong> offers an unparalleled gaming experience that caters to all. Spin the wheel, place your bets, and see if luck is on your side!</p>",
    "short_description": "Real Roulette is a casino simulation game featuring American and European roulette. Experience realistic physics for authentic ball and wheel interactions. Use data analysis to refine strategies, achieve milestones, and climb leaderboards. Spin and bet for a thrilling casino experience!",
